edicationStorage / </span>A1_MedicationStorage</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Zijn er opmerkingen of bezorgdheden omtrent de (correcte) thuisbewaring van de medicatie?</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">1..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-choice\">choice</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Options: <a href=\"#opt-item.A1_MedicationStorage\">2 options</a></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck1100.png)\" id=\"item.A2_MedicationStorageSpecify\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin_end.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-string.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"string\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">HomehospOpatShortIVQuestionnaireDefinition / NursingAssessment / MedicationStorage / </span>A2_MedicationStorageSpecify</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">&gt; Indien opmerkingen of bezorgdheid: specifieer</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-string\">string</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Enable When: <span><a href=\"#item.A1_MedicationStorage\">A1_MedicationStorage</a> = Improper storage of medicati